in="03:04.790" end="03:06.230">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.370" end="03:13.160"><span begin="03:07.370" end="03:07.550">The </span><span begin="03:07.550" end="03:08.210">sky's </span><span begin="03:08.210" end="03:08.600">so </span><span begin="03:08.600" end="03:10.850">blue </span><span begin="03:10.850" end="03:11.120">in </span><span begin="03:11.120" end="03:13.160">Malibu</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.600" end="03:15.440"><span begin="03:14.600" end="03:14.960">Next </span><span begin="03:14.960" end="03:15.080">to </span><span begin="03:15.080" end="03:15.440">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.560" end="03:23.960"><span begin="03:18.560" end="03:19.250">We </span><span begin="03:19.250" end="03:19.640">are </span><span begin="03:19.640" end="03:19.970">just </span><span begin="03:19.970" end="03:20.300">like </span><span begin="03:20.300" end="03:20.450">the </span><span begin="03:20.450" end="03:21.170">waves </span><span begin="03:21.170" end="03:21.320">that </span><span begin="03:21.320" end="03:21.710">flow </span><span begin="03:21.710" end="03:22.160">back </span><span begin="03:22.160" end="03:22.670">and </span><span begin="03:22.670" end="03:23.960">forth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.490" end="03:28.040"><span begin="03:25.490" end="03:26.360">Sometimes </span><span begin="03:26.360" end="03:26.420">I </span><span begin="03:26.420" end="03:26.840">feel </span><span begin="03:26.840" end="03:27.200">like </span><span begin="03:27.200" end="03:27.350">I'm </span><span begin="03:27.350" end="03:28.040">drowning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:28.040" end="03:29.810"><span begin="03:28.040" end="03:28.220">And </span><span begin="03:28.220" end="03:28.550">you're </span><span begin="03:28.550" end="03:28.880">there </span><span begin="03:28.880" end="03:28.970">to </span><span begin="03:28.970" end="03:29.420">save </span><span begin="03:29.420" end="03:29.810">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.810" end="03:34.310"><span begin="03:29.810" end="03:30.050">And </span><span begin="03:30.050" end="03:30.290">I </span><span begin="03:30.290" end="03:30.740">wanna </span><span begin="03:30.740" end="03:31.160">thank </span><span begin="03:31.160" end="03:31.430">you </span><span begin="03:31.430" end="03:31.700">with </span><span begin="03:31.700" end="03:32.090">all </span><span begin="03:32.090" end="03:32.300">of </span><span begin="03:32.300" end="03:32.870">my </span><span begin="03:32.870" end="03:34.310">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.610" end="03:37.520"><span begin="03:34.610" end="03:34.910">It's </span><span begin="03:34.910" end="03:35.000">a </span><span begin="03:35.000" end="03:35.690">brand </span><span begin="03:35.690" end="03:36.290">new </span><span begin="03:36.290" end="03:37.520">start</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:38.330" end="03:44.360"><span begin="03:38.330" end="03:38.480">A </span><span begin="03:38.480" end="03:39.170">dream </span><span begin="03:39.170" end="03:39.830">come </span><span begin="03:39.830" end="03:41.750">true </span><span begin="03:41.750" end="03:41.930">in </span><span begin="03:41.930" end="03:44.360">Malibu</span></p></div></body></tt>